WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The hollow key slides over a guide pin that keeps it centred.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.042
Each slot has left room for a ward. The far end of the bit can now reach the bolt.

00:00:06.042 --> 00:00:08.417
The bit pushes a projection on the bolt called the talon. The bolt slides back.

00:00:08.417 --> 00:00:10.000
The bolt has cleared the frame. The door can swing open.
